factions from across the galaxy have come to Earth to wage epic
warfare.<br>
With the increasing shift towards Internet video content, that makes a
whole lot of video that needs recontextualizing for different
audiences.<br>
Share a song session over the Internet with up to four other musicians
to play along with each other in what feels like real-time with no
worries about latency.<br>
Consider handling of electrical noise.<br>
